### Diabet Asistan Backend Smoke Test
### Use with VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Start backend first:
### cd backend\diabet-asistan-api
### .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/info

### Create Family
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/families
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Family"
}

### Create Child User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyId": 1,
  "displayName": "Child Demo",
  "role": "CHILD",
  "email": null
}

### Create Parent User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyId": 1,
  "displayName": "Parent Demo",
  "role": "PARENT",
  "email": null
}

### Create Meal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyId": 1,
  "childId": 1,
  "mealTime": "2026-06-11T18:30:00Z",
  "mealType": "DINNER",
  "foodName": "Pasta",
  "description": "Pasta with tomato sauce",
  "photoPath": null,
  "estimatedCarbsGram": 60,
  "createdByUserId": 1
}

### Get Pending Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meals/family/1/pending-review

### Correct Meal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meals/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": 2,
  "reviewStatus": "CORRECTED",
  "correctedCarbsGram": 70,
  "comment": "Portion was larger than expected."
}

### Get Meal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meals/1

### Create Family Recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/family-recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyId": 1,
  "name": "Lentil soup",
  "description": "Family recipe",
  "totalCarbsGram": 180,
  "servings": 6,
  "defaultPortionDescription": "1 bowl",
  "createdByParentId": 2
}

### Get Recipes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/family-recipes/family/1
